<title>ESTONIA: NEW TRADER FOR TALLINN STOCK EXCHANGE.</title>
<headline>NEW TRADER FOR TALLINN STOCK EXCHANGE.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>AS Beeta Invest has the right to use the bourse trading system from August 13, the Tallinn stock exchange said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The stock exchange said in a statement that the trader for Beeta Invest is Tarmo Lehtmets.</p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9202 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
